{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35872","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 十 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"任说天长海影沈，友朋情比未爲深。\n唯应乐处无虚日，大半危时得道心。\n命达夭殇同白首，价高甎瓦即黄金。\n他年有要玄珠者，赤水萦纡试一寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}